# fontpick: shows the 256 characters of a font in a 16 by 16 grid, its name above. A font name typed into the text field at the foot and
# Return shows that font (the window takes the keys with the pointer inside it); the QUIT button ends the program. Three fonts: fixed,
# a sans bold 18, a name the server has none of (the subtitle says it cannot find the font); then QUIT.
move 250 626
wait
type fixed
key Return
wait
type sans,bold,18
key Return
wait
type nosuchfont
key Return
wait
click 1 488 625
